Mumble is a Teamspeak-like confcall program and protocol.
The nice guys of http://www.mtc-infomedia.de/ provide us the public server mumble.saarwave.de

So check out the Lojban chatroom in mumble.saarwave.de :)

You'll need the [http://mumble.sf.net/|Mumble client].
You can register your nickname at http://mumble.saarwave.de/